  m_text: "It\u2019s the 5th largest moon in the solar system.\n\nIt\u2019s the only
    celestial body beyond Earth where humans have walked.\nThe first moon landing
    was in 1969 by Apollo 11.\n\nThe Moon controls Earth's tides through its gravity.\n\nIt
    goes through 8 visible phases (e.g., full moon, crescent, new moon)."
