  m_text: "The only known planet with life.\n\nEarth has seasons because its axis
    is tilted at 23.5 degrees.\n\nIt\u2019s protected by a magnetic field that shields
    it from harmful solar radiation.\n\nIt has a moderate climate, stable temperature
    range, and water in all 3 states (solid, liquid, gas)."
